Read the repository root `AGENTS.md` and the target directory's `AGENTS.md`
before editing. They are the canonical project rules.
For implementation, review, integration/release or handoff, read the matching
`.agents/skills/kdp-dev/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/kdp-review/SKILL.md`,
`.agents/skills/kdp-release/SKILL.md` or
`.agents/skills/kdp-handoff/SKILL.md`.
For ordinary development, the shared kdp-dev skill is sufficient after the
root and target rules. Read `docs/development/README.md` only for routing,
continuation, review, handoff or release.
Loading a skill does not authorize Git or remote mutations.
Paths above are relative to the repository root.
